{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09215","headline":"沣上精舍荅赵氏外生伉 · 韦应物","name":"沣上精舍荅赵氏外生伉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远迹出尘表，寓身双树林。\n如何小子伉，亦有超世心。\n担书从我游，携手广川阴。\n云开夏郊绿，景晏青山沈。\n对榻遇清夜，献诗合雅音。\n所推苟礼数，於性道岂深。\n隐拙在冲默，经世昧古今。\n无爲率尔言，可以致华簪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09215.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09215","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}